WEBVTT

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:20.380
It's morning.

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:29.260
Today is...

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:30.660
The entrance ceremony!

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.400
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.240
Question, question, question,
question, question mark

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.610
Lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing about

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:45.550
What should we do?

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:50.720
