00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:52.250
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.650
Wa! Shoi!

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.320
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:02.330
Even an absurd response

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:05.230
Is sensible for someone from Jupiter

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.340
Launch a rocket at random

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:10.170
And approach the place where it lands

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:14.840
After a pleasant nap

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:19.250
Sure enough, sure enough,
my eyes tear when I yawn

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:20.420
Good morning

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:21.580
Let's play!

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.290
Let's have a serious bread-eating race

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:25.420
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:27.960
Who, who, who, who, who is it?

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:31.290
Hungry, hungry, hungry,
hungry, hungry person

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:35.700
Girls live off snacks

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:37.470
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!
Rolling, rolling, rolling, golfing around

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:38.270
Rolling, rolling, rolling, golfing around

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:41.600
Lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing about

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:45.510
Let's look up at the sun

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:48.780
Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.310
In a dream, in a dream with everyone
Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:53.880
I had the same conversation

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.790
Question mark and washoi 365

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:59.580
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:05.550
It's here!
April 7, Entrance Ceremony
and Welcome Party

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:14.490
Yunocchi! It's morning!

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:18.080
Good morning! You're up early, Miya-chan!

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:21.960
You're up early too, Miss Yuno.

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:26.230
Actually, I was so excited I
couldn't get any sleep.

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:29.700
I think that you're going to fall
asleep during the ceremony.

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:30.900
Bread (English)

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:34.280
Did you eat breakfast?
I have some bread if you want!

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:36.540
I'll have some.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.080
By the way, Yuno, what is this?

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.170
It's a fried egg.

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.520
You still haven't flipped it over.

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:52.120
Sorry...

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.890
At my home, we always flip it over.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:59.030
Klang...

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.030
It's a holiday! Stop making so much noise!

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.410
U-Umm...

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.380
Even though you two have
an entrance ceremony,

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.510
the second and third year students
aren't obligated to go to it!

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:11.150
In other words, it's a holiday!

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:13.050
Don't make so much noise!

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:16.410
S-Sorry, I didn't know.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:21.190
Well, as long as you understand.

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:21.960
By the way,

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:22.550
Bow
By the way,

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.230
who are you?

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:25.530
What?

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:30.600
Didn't you hear from Hiro?
I heard a lot about you.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:33.430
Oh! Are you from Room 102?

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:34.660
That's right.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:38.610
Ah, I see Miyako's here too.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.630
Good morning, Chie.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:43.180
Sae!

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:46.080
Oh no! Look at the time!

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:49.850
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What are we going to do?!

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:51.650
You still have time.

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:53.390
Calm down and get prepared.

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:54.760
Umm...

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:57.830
I already have my writing tools
and important papers.

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:02.190
I have my handkerchief,
facial tissues and my wallet.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.330
Have any paper towels?

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:06.300
Paper towels?

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.400
Aren't facial tissues enough?

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.440
Miyako, get changed!

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:12.100
You're making things more complicated!

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:16.130
Anyway, there's no need to be so nervous.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.310
That's true, but...

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:22.980
I've always dreamed of going to
Yamabuki High School.

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:26.650
Just wearing this uniform makes me excited.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:31.180
It feels strange for me to be wearing it.

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:33.820
It's not strange at all.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.460
Miya-chan, you're dressed funny.
Miyako, you're dressed funny.

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:42.940
A Few Minutes Later

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.310
All right! I'm ready for school!

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:47.640
Let's go, Yuno!

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.270
O-Okay...

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:55.110
