when I took the exam.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.950
It sure feels nice to be welcomed.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.620
The class assignments have been posted!

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:40.650
Umm...

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.360
Miya-chan! Miya-chan!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.490
We're in the same class!

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.130
Huh?

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.270
Entrance Ceremony

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:53.040
I'm glad we're in the same class!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.170
Yeah!

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.450
Umm, the Yamabuki High School Entrance
Ceremony will now begin.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:58.780
It's starting.
Umm, the Yamabuki High School Entrance
Ceremony will now begin.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:04.340
First off, a speech from the principal
of Yamabuki High School.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.580
