00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:14.000
H-His face is so long!

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.620
Miya-chan!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:19.330
And so, you must use your overflowing
youth to your advantage

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:22.100
