00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.220
POMF

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.120
Aaagh!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:40.990
Aaagh!
Huh?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:47.020
I wanted to see them off this morning.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:51.070
Miyako was perfectly fine.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:52.530
